sional action from the  white house to the schoolhouse  now is the time for my  republican colleagues to put up or shut  up it's  that simple even the vice president said  friday she's not overly optimistic when  sandy hook happened nothing happened but  you know i do believe that people can  learn and i do believe that people can  revisit an issue like this and perhaps  have a change of heart in mind  now the house judiciary committee did  manage to advance a more strict gun  control reform bill one that has  virtually no chance in the senate senate  majority leader chuck schumer said if  the negotiators seem close to a deal  he's going to give them the time they  need to get there if not he wants  everyone on the record on these issues  and could hold a vote as soon as next  week dana  those school house voices may not be  able to vote yet christina but hard to  not hear the words that they are saying  thank you
 

